## Active Plan: 001-selection-translate

Read `specs/001-selection-translate/plan.md` for architecture and project structure.

**Tech stack**: WXT + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 4
**Key libraries**: @floating-ui/dom (positioning), @webext-core/messaging, openai stream (SiliconFlow), zod
**Streaming**: Port-based lookupStream; loading until first chunk, then incremental render
**LLM**: 硅基流动 `https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1`，默认模型 `Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct`，用户自备 API Key
**UX**: 选中文字 → 下方图标 → 悬停展示 SENTENWORD 风格 AI 查词弹框；处理 flip/shift 边界
**Out of scope**: 收藏、专业词典 Tab、发音、全页翻译

**Commands**: `pnpm dev` | `pnpm build` | `pnpm test`
**Docs**: `specs/001-selection-translate/{spec,plan,research,data-model,quickstart}.md`
